    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Making its debut on Balenciaga's Winter 26 runway, the Hourglass Avenue carries forward the line's signature hourglass silhouette. Drawing on the flap construction of the classic doctor's bag, it is crafted from specially treated Box calfskin that holds a structured shape while staying supple to the touch. A minimalist brass clasp sits at the flap, engraved with the house logo and the words \"10 Avenue George V\" — a nod to the brand's couture atelier at 10 Avenue George V in Paris.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
