      "text": "The Le City motorcycle-bag family welcomes a chain pouch, cut to a sleek, slim rectangular silhouette with a flap closure and finished with the line's signature distressed-metal studs, buckles and whipstitched fringe. This version comes in Light Terracotta waxed suede calfskin, paired with a sliding metal chain strap that converts from a single to a double length — letting you wear it over the shoulder, crossbody or in hand.",
